              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eberhard+Zeidler"}> Eberhard Zeidler
              , sections 7.19.1–3 in
              %em Quantum field theory. A bridge between mathematicians and physicists – volume I
              Springer (2009) (
              %a{:href => "http://www.mis.mpg.de/zeidler/qft.html"}> web
              ).
          %p To check conventions at least, see Wikipedia:
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heisenberg_picture"}> Heisenberg picture
              ,
            %li
              %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger_picture"}> Schrödinger picture
              \.
          %p
            Subtleties with the Schrödinger picture for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+theory"} field theory
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetime"} spacetime
            dimension
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo ≥
                  %mn 3
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \geq 3
            is discussed in
          %ul
            %li#TorreVaradarajan98
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Torre"}> Charles Torre
              , M. Varadarajan,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Functional Evolution of Free Quantum Fields
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9811222"} arXiv:hep-th/9811222
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/operator+algebra"} Operator algebraic
            formulation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+error+correction"} quantum error correction
            in the Heisenberg picture:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Cédric Bény, Achim Kempf, David W. Kribs,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Generalization of Quantum Error Correction via the Heisenberg Picture
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.98.100502"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.98.100502
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0608071"} arXiv:quant-ph/0608071
            %li
              %p
                Cédric Bény, Achim Kempf, David W. Kribs,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantum Error Correction of Observables
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0705.1574"} arXiv:0705.1574
          %div
            %h3#ReferencesRelationBetweenAQFTAndFQFT Relation between algebraic and functorial field theory
            %p
              On the relation between
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functorial+quantum+field+theory"} functorial quantum field theory
              (axiomatizing the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Schr%C3%B6dinger+picture"} Schrödinger picture
              of
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+field+theory"} quantum field theory
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+quantum+field+theory"} algebraic quantum field theory
              (axiomatizing the
              = succeed "):" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Heisenberg+picture"} Heisenberg picture
            %ul
              %li#Schreiber09
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs Schreiber
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/files/AQFTfromFQFT.pdf", :title => "AQFT from n-Functorial QFT"} AQFT from n-Functorial QFT
                  %strong 291
                  2 (2009) 357-401 &amp;lbrack;
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0806.1079"}> arXiv:0806.1079
                  ,
                  = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-009-0840-2"} doi:10.1007/s00220-009-0840-2
              %li#Johnson-Freyd21
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Theo+Johnson-Freyd"}> Theo Johnson-Freyd
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Heisenberg-picture quantum field theory
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Representation Theory, Mathematical Physics, and Integrable Systems
                  %strong 340
                  (2021) &amp;lbrack;
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1508.05908"}> arXiv:1508.05908
                  ,
                  = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-78148-4_13"} doi:10.1007/978-3-030-78148-4_13
              %li#BunkMacManusSchenkel23
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Severin+Bunk"}> Severin Bunk
                  ,
